1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,109
Woman: Are you all set for the conference next week?

2
00:00:08,109 --> 00:00:15,010
Man: Almost. I just booked my flight this morning, so that's one thing off the list.

3
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:20,040
Woman: That's great. Did you already register for the conference itself?

4
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:25,416
Man: Not yet. I was waiting to confirm my travel plans first.

5
00:00:25,416 --> 00:00:29,000
I'll take care of the registration this afternoon.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,050
Hopefully, there are still spots left for the breakout sessions.

7
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:38,110
Woman: If you want, I can forward you the link I used to register.

8
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:42,050
It also has a list of the sessions that still have space.

9
00:00:42,050 --> 00:00:46,150
Man: That would be really helpful. Thanks.
